-------------------------------------------------------------------------
A personal note from the author (not a license condition)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------
BingoCaller was written in my own time as a private project, to help
clubs, schools, charities and friends run a good bingo night. I would love it
to be used for the better good: for fun, community and fundraising for good
causes. Please do not use it to deceive or harm people. This is a request from
me, not a legal restriction: the license above is the MIT License and applies
in full.

This is a personal project. It is not a product of, and is not endorsed by,
any employer or company the author works for.
